                    <description>&lt;p&gt;---------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;
DESCRIPTION&lt;br/&gt;
---------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;
When Java8 MessagingExample start without remote nodes it&apos;s get &quot;Please start at least 2 cluster nodes to run example.&quot; twice. There is 3 needless system.out.println as the same print is in checkMinTopologySize method&lt;br/&gt;
---------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;
STEPS FOR REPRODUCE&lt;br/&gt;
---------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;
1. Run Java8 MessagingExample&lt;br/&gt;
